        "image_opacity": 65,
        "crumb": "The Estate",
        "eyebrow": "Morghew Park Estate · Tenterden, Kent",
        "headline": "A working estate, first and foremost.",
        "lede": "A little over two thousand acres of Kentish weald. A thriving trade in potatoes, arable land farmed regeneratively and sustainably. Ancient woodland responsibly managed for habitat, firewood, and game. Cold-pressed oils, small-batch vodka, venison and game from our own shoot. This is where it all comes from."
